<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAFRICA STOPS ALPHA , BLUE CIRCLE MERGER.</title>
<headline>SAFRICA STOPS ALPHA , BLUE CIRCLE MERGER.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African Trade and Industry Minister Alec Erwin announced on Wednesday that the proposed merger between cement companies Alpha Ltd and Blue Circle Cement would not be allowed.</p>
</text>
